      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VELOCITY ZIGGY (1) trailed the lead and fought on well to be beaten 2.5 lengths into second (23.95) at this track in a Grade 5 over 407m. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to her name from five starts. Can go on with it. TUSKEN TIGER (5) was sent out long odds last time but rocketed out of the boxes with a fast early sectional and gave a sight before being swallowed up late, finishing a 1.5 lengths second (24.02) over 407m at this track. Has good box speed and can overcome the tricky draw. Expected to be in this for a long way. PETITE MISS (2) had the drop on the lead early on but could only manage third, beaten 5 lengths (24.12) at this track in a Grade 5 over 407m. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to her name from six starts. Can measure up. TIJUANA TWINKLE (7) cannot be ruled out.",
